# God-metric (feature passes)

Before calling a feature pass done, answer:

> Would a student screenshot this interaction and send it to the group chat?

If **no** — it is not done. Prefer moments that look shareable: clear before/after, one proud result, honest limits (not fake magic), and continuity that feels inevitable ("it was already on my laptop").
